          "subject": "face",
          "emotion": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Outro",
      "beats": [
        {
          "vo": "So here's the uncomfortable part. You didn't reason your way to most of what you believe today. Your biases did. They're not a glitch in the system. Running fast and cheap, they are the system.",
          "scene": "explainer",
          "prop": "brain",
          "emotion": "serious-expert",
          "chapterStart": true
        },
        {
          "vo": "But remember that jacket? Two hundred, crossed out to eighty-nine? Now you'll see the anchor every time you shop. And once you can name a bias, it loses a little of its grip on you.",
          "scene": "story",
          "room": "store-aisle",
          "emotion": "smug",
          "camera": "slowZoom",
          "mascots": [
            {
